    Report on <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1350102/000095017023022273/asti-20230331.htm" STYLE="-sec-extract: exhibit">Form 10-Q</A> for the quarter ended March 31, 2023, filed with the SEC on May 15, 2023;</FONT></TD></TR>
