    <TD STYLE="width: 98%; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the description of our securities registered pursuant to Section 12 of the Exchange Act in our </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Registration Statement on <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1350102/000107997322000998/asti_8a12b.htm" STYLE="-sec-extract: exhibit">Form 8-A</A></FONT> <FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(File No. 001-32919), filed with the SEC under Section 12(b) of the Exchange Act, on August 16, 2022, including any amendment or report filed for the purpose of updating such description.</FONT></TD></TR>
